## Data Entry Flow

```
Staff enter data into the Google Sheet tabs
    ↓
Run "Generate Pending Reports" (or wait for 18:30 trigger)
    ↓
Google Doc report created in Drive output folder
    ↓
Review Doc → add PM signature → share/print
```

