## Troubleshooting

| Issue | Fix |
|-------|-----|
| `Sheet "X" not found` | Check tab names in `CONFIG.SHEETS` match exactly (case-sensitive) |
| Template placeholders not replaced | Ensure Doc tags use `<<[FieldName]>>` format with no extra spaces |
| Trigger not firing | Re-run **Setup Daily Trigger** from the menu |
| clasp push fails | Re-run `clasp login` and update `CLASP_CREDENTIALS` secret |
| Doc created but blank | Check `Report_ID` column – must match exactly across all sheets |

